# Commands

Install with `python3 -m venv .venv` and `.venv/bin/pip install -e ".[dev]"`.

Run `.venv/bin/buy-vs-rent serve` with `BUY_VS_RENT_SSL_CERT` and `BUY_VS_RENT_SSL_KEY` set, and `.venv/bin/buy-vs-rent run <file>`. Tests are `.venv/bin/pytest tests`. Do not set `PYTHONPATH` for these.
